      "updated": 1779099540930,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SCRIPTED\n- Pong boss\n- Cake boss \n- Dance minigame?\n- Exoskeleton\n- Trex boss\n- Tank boss\n- Cockroach boss\n- Turtle (awake, 25%, 75%)\n- Tentacle boss\n- Frank boss\n- Glacier boss?\n- Final boss?\n\n- Puzzle solved / \"thing happened\"\n    - first chest opened, giant chicken poop, credits makes me happy, headless robots, shoot at the vegetation\n    - first cockroach dead by laser\n    - bell puzzle solved, planets aligned, train grenadier sequence finished\n\nSYSTEMIC\n- Traversal, throw, punch... (efforts)\n- Death (1)\n\nOTHER\n- Trigger volumes age condition ?? no me convence",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SCRIPTED\n- Pong boss\n- Cake boss \n- Dance minigame?\n- Exoskeleton\n- Trex boss\n- Tank boss\n- Cockroach boss\n- Turtle (awake, 25%, 75%)\n- Tentacle boss\n- Frank boss\n- Glacier boss?\n- Final boss?\n\n- Puzzle solved / \"thing happened\"\n    - first chest opened, giant chicken poop, credits makes me happy, headless robots, shoot at the vegetation\n    - first cockroach dead by laser\n    - bell puzzle solved, planets aligned, train grenadier sequence finished\n\nSYSTEMIC\n- Traversal, throw, punch... (efforts)\n- Death (1)\n\nOTHER\n- Trigger volumes age condition ?? no me convence",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
